# Live2D: Cubism Core + sample models are fetched (sha256-pinned), never committed (no redistribution)
live2d/media/
live2d/node_modules/
*.moc3
*.zip
# reference studies: the media and derived stills stay on the box; the dossier, transcript and watch report are the record
projects/*/reference/*/*
!projects/*/reference/*/DOSSIER.md
!projects/*/reference/*/WATCH.md
!projects/*/reference/*/watch.json
!projects/*/reference/*/transcript.json
